WEBVTT

00:33:25.621 --> 00:33:31.454
Well, anything to be out in nature
before that really crystallized,

00:33:31.954 --> 00:33:37.579
I wanted to be poet laureate. I used to
read so much poetry and write books.

00:33:39.204 --> 00:33:42.496
What is the worst career advice
you've ever received?

00:33:45.871 --> 00:33:48.538
Well, I suppose it was what the
professors told me when

00:33:48.538 --> 00:33:51.413
I went to Cambridge that I've
done everything wrong.

00:33:52.496 --> 00:33:55.288
And it turns out they were the ones who
had done everything wrong, didn't it?

00:33:57.746 --> 00:34:03.329
That's poetic justice to your poetry. Yeah
, write your poetry fashion.